sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User
    participant App as POS App
    participant Repo as Payment Repository
    participant DB as Encrypted Local Storage
    participant SDK as POS SDK
    participant GW as Payment Gateway
    User ->> App: Enter amount & start payment
    App ->> Repo: startPayment(amount, Card)
    Repo ->> Repo: Create PaymentIntent (intentId, idempotencyKey)
    Repo ->> DB: Save PaymentIntent (PENDING)
    Repo ->> SDK: Read card
    SDK -->> Repo: Payment token
    Repo ->> GW: charge(amount, idempotencyKey)

    alt Success
        GW -->> Repo: Success(transactionId)
        Repo ->> DB: Update intent (COMPLETED, transactionId)
        Repo -->> App: Payment success

    else Failure (non-retryable)
        GW -->> Repo: Failure(errorCode)
        Repo ->> DB: Update intent (FAILED)
        Repo -->> App: Payment failed

    else Failure (retryable)
        GW -->> Repo: Failed(retryable)
        Repo ->> DB: Update intent (PENDING, lastError=retryable)
        Repo -->> App: Payment retryable

    else Timeout / Network error
        GW --x Repo: No response
        Repo ->> DB: Keep intent (PENDING)
        Repo -->> App: Payment retryable
    end
